      </section>
      <section id="fs-id1167836705576" data-source="A20:m81374#fs-id1167836705576" data-kind="translation"><h4>प्रश्न 10</h4><div id="fs-id1167836705579" class="problem"><p id="fs-id1167836529723"><span class="math" data-check="q10">2x + y = 7</span></p></div><p data-kind="original" class="source-answer-missing">स्रोतात या प्रश्नाचे उत्तर दिलेले नाही. स्वतः सोडवा.</p></section>
